{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When cleanliness reaches perfection, nothing remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hum of tireless machines...<br>The slow spin of laundry under dim light...<br>Here, cleanliness is not a routine \u2014 it\u2019s a law.<br>And you are the silent part of this order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLEAN it DRY it</strong> is an atmospheric simulation set in a cold industrial facility.<br>In this looped place, you must solve difficult puzzles and make sure you are truly doing what must be done.<br>Remember \u2014 this experience starts over every time you begin.<br>This world is a living system...<br>And that\u2019s why saving the game is impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear doesn\u2019t come suddenly here.<br>It seeps into the hum of machines, into the trembling walls.<br>As the line between reality and simulation blurs,<br>every decision leads you to a different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stains can\u2019t be removed.<br>Some stains are what made you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4165960?t=1773320114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165960/5de552eca32ba29ac7839012994b9a854eed972e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773320114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165960/6796d37b455359d1d614f8d0c5afb7915b60a1b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773320114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165960/6796d37b455359d1d614f8d0c5afb7915b60a1b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773320114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When cleanliness reaches perfection, nothing remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hum of tireless machines...<br>The slow spin of laundry under dim light...<br>Here, cleanliness is not a routine \u2014 it\u2019s a law.<br>And you are the silent part of this order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLEAN it DRY it</strong> is an atmospheric simulation set in a cold industrial facility.<br>In this looped place, you must solve difficult puzzles and make sure you are truly doing what must be done.<br>Remember \u2014 this experience starts over every time you begin.<br>This world is a living system...<br>And that\u2019s why saving the game is impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear doesn\u2019t come suddenly here.<br>It seeps into the hum of machines, into the trembling walls.<br>As the line between reality and simulation blurs,<br>every decision leads you to a different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stains can\u2019t be removed.<br>Some stains are what made you.</p>","developers":["Tifonne"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165960/f6b19e57c401a2665abd04b22618ffff58e6d730/header.jpg?t=1773320114","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4165960/2138704797/85aa8ee2ab56b9fe12480e2d8a2ba17a39b24c77/1762631833/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762835486","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4165960/2138704797/85aa8ee2ab56b9fe12480e2d8a2ba17a39b24c77/1762631833/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762835486","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4165960/2138704797/85aa8ee2ab56b9fe124